# instance/config/active-preset is DEPLOYMENT-LOCAL (gitignored): each machine
# picks its own preset without dirtying git pulls on the others (the Mini soak
# runs `work`, hq runs `portfolio`).
#
# The real file must contain ONLY the preset slug (load-preset.sh reads the
# whole file as the slug — do NOT copy this commented example verbatim):
#   echo work > instance/config/active-preset
# Slugs ship in presets/: work | portfolio | step-network | personal.
# Default below is the functional five-officer `work` preset:
work
